#: ../../source/references_paper-explainer.md:5
msgid "Why animate a paper?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_paper-explainer.md:7
msgid ""
"A research paper is optimized for precision and completeness. A video is "
"optimized for understanding and retention. The translation is NOT \"read "
"the paper aloud with pictures\" — it's \"extract the core insight and "
"make it feel obvious through visual storytelling.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_paper-explainer.md:9
msgid ""
"The paper has one job: prove the claim is true. The video has a different"
" job: make the viewer understand WHY the claim is true, and WHY it "
"matters."
msgstr ""

